precision zero point one seven.

15
00:01:23,437 --> 00:01:26,334
The fault needs two conditions at once.

16
00:01:27,290 --> 00:01:33,497
No model wrote this. It's compiled into
SigNoz's own grammar — A implies B, and

17
00:01:33,577 --> 00:01:38,129
