28
00:02:29,387 --> 00:02:35,180
None of them hand you back a query, a
dashboard, and an armed tripwire.

29
00:02:38,210 --> 00:02:44,417
Here's what matters more. Point it at a
decoy — an attribute that tracks failure

30
00:02:44,497 --> 00:02:51,118
but doesn't cause it — and it abstains.
Point it at a healthy system, it abstains

31
00:02:51,198 --> 00:02:55,749
